The system must be diagnosable.

25.1 Structured errors

Define predictable error handling for:

- Authentication.
- Authorization.
- Missing conversations.
- Blocked participants.
- Invalid message payloads.
- Upload failures.
- Network failures.
- Rate limits.
- Storage access.
- Search failures.
- Function failures.
- Permission denial.

